What's the blast radius if we start batching training jobs more aggressively? I want to make sure we're not trading $20K in savings for longer training cycles that block product work.","ts":"1706068012.000000","type":"message","user":"U_ROBERT","username":"robert.chen"},{"channel":{"id":"C_INFRA","name":"core-infra","is_private":false,"is_mpim":false,"is_ext_shared":false,"is_org_shared":false,"is_pending_ext_shared":false,"is_shared":false,"pending_shared":[]},"iid":"fa216743-3a61-4ba4-91fc-51021941b786","permalink":"https://example.slack.com/archives/C_INFRA/p1706068546000000","team":"T01WORKSPACE","text":"Sounds good. @priya once you have those numbers, let's look at the distribution too—I want to know if we're consistently underutilized or if it's spiky. That'll tell us whether batching alone solves it or if we need to right-size the instance types.

